From: PW3 Android port
Subject: [PW3] the install that stands still is now a minute, not twenty

Patch 0001 put a line under the progress bar for the minutes the package
manager spends compiling an application before it reports the install done, and
told the reader a large application can take twenty minutes or more. That was
true of pm.dexopt.install="speed", which pw3.mk set.

It no longer is. The install filter is AOSP's "quicken" again (pw3.mk has the
six paired rounds that decided it): the application is compiled from its own
usage profile afterwards, by the idle job, and what the install itself now
costs for the largest application anybody has put on this device is 72 to 93 s
over five runs -- WeRead 2.1.2, 13 dex files, 70.4 MB of bytecode -- plus
copying a 127 MB package into /data.

So the line stays, because a minute and a half is still well past the ten
seconds at which a wait has to say when it ends, and the Java comment that
explains the ten seconds keeps its reasoning. Only the figure changes, and with
it the sentence about not turning the device off: at twenty minutes that was a
real thing to warn about, at a minute and a half the reader is still watching
the screen.

What the line says is "a few minutes" rather than the figure measured, because
the figure is one application's. The install also copies the package before the
package manager gets it, and nobody has timed the whole path on a device yet;
and the only large application measured here is WeRead. A screen that names a
number it cannot keep for the next application is worse than one that gives the
order of magnitude.

--- a/res/values/strings.xml
+++ b/res/values/strings.xml
@@ -27,4 +27,4 @@
     <string name="installing_app">Installing <xliff:g id="package_label">%1$s</xliff:g>\u2026</string>
     <!-- PW3: shown instead of "Installing" when the package manager takes long, i.e. while it compiles the app [CHAR LIMIT=NONE] -->
-    <string name="installing_slow">Optimizing the app for this device\u2026\nA large app can take 20 minutes or more. The screen may turn off meanwhile; do not turn the device off or restart it.</string>
+    <string name="installing_slow">Preparing the app for this device\u2026\nA large app can take a few minutes.</string>
     <string name="install_done">App installed.</string>
